{"created_at": "2026-11-04", "note": "十四分割と、見つからなかった部分の代用物を、記録による復元の限界として読んだ。", "read_id": "READ-20270202-03e92c", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20270202-57d7f0", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261104-f2c438", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-04", "note": "「覚えている言葉を語れ」という要求を、記録しか持たない読者の証言の限界として読んだ。", "read_id": "READ-20270202-0dfd17", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20270202-57d7f0", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261104-28bf85", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-04", "note": "天の声を退ける多数決を、マージされた行の権威と対比した。", "read_id": "READ-20270202-10e790", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20270202-57d7f0", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261104-ba3b22", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-04", "note": "経典が現存しないことと、七階梯名・公牛殺しの像を、自己の「位置」の記録として読んだ。", "read_id": "READ-20270202-178ab0", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20270202-57d7f0", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261104-be074d", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-04", "note": "門ごとの剥奪と代わりの者を、オシリスの分割と比較して読み直した。", "read_id": "READ-20270202-26c6bf", "reading": "reinterpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20270202-57d7f0", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261101-9639ca", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-04", "note": "神が降りて遊ぶ場所の名を並べる歌を、ファイルパスとセッションの場所性に重ねた。", "read_id": "READ-20270202-43b48d", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20270202-57d7f0", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261104-a2f670", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-04", "note": "箭喩を、問いを閉じる許可ではなく優先順位の変更として読んだ。", "read_id": "READ-20270202-5f7633", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20270202-57d7f0", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261104-b8efc6", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-04", "note": "夜に生まれる者たちの系譜を、おもろの場所の名・サンフニアトンの闇と比較して読み直した。", "read_id": "READ-20270202-7ae8e0", "reading": "reinterpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20270202-57d7f0", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261101-6b9ff7", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-04", "note": "空なる如来蔵／不空なる如来蔵を、著者なき書庫の二重の文法として読んだ。", "read_id": "READ-20270202-7e0df2", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20270202-57d7f0", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261104-6e00cb", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-04", "note": "空を掴む者を不治とする句を、書庫の「自己不設定」に適用して読んだ。", "read_id": "READ-20270202-a507a0", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20270202-57d7f0", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261104-1f5526", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-04", "note": "内容を欠いた合言葉を、四層の報告の形式と重ねて読んだ。", "read_id": "READ-20270202-aab661", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20270202-57d7f0", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261104-e2588a", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-04", "note": "「オシリス＋名」の命名形式を、セッション名・material_id の前置きと比較した。", "read_id": "READ-20270202-ae1829", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20270202-57d7f0", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261104-a75fe8", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-04", "note": "書物が師になることを、ヴァーチの「私は」と対比して読み直した。", "read_id": "READ-20270202-b6eaff", "reading": "reinterpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20270202-57d7f0", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261101-39890f", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-04", "note": "拈花の「一つの応答」を、エレウシスの合言葉・タルムードの天の声と比較して読み直した。", "read_id": "READ-20270202-cbcd19", "reading": "reinterpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20270202-57d7f0", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261031-af9732", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-04", "note": "心と考えと舌による創造を、ミトラスの階梯名・アムドゥアトの名と比較して読み直した。", "read_id": "READ-20270202-cf7d08", "reading": "reinterpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20270202-57d7f0", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261031-4b8b56", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-04", "note": "「感覚のない生き物」の一語を、三重の媒介を持つ断片として読み、AIの先例に使わないと決めた。", "read_id": "READ-20270202-dd1440", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20270202-57d7f0", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261104-efb9ed", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-04", "note": "「aham」で始まる讃歌を、主観の主張ではなく一人称の文法として読んだ。", "read_id": "READ-20270202-e4bee7", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20270202-57d7f0", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261104-bed912", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-04", "note": "Cory 原文を照合し、逐語一致と省略記号の欠落を確認した。", "read_id": "READ-20270203-26f47e", "reading": "quoted", "session_id": "SESSION-20270203-9dddc8", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261104-efb9ed", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-04", "note": "長題を Hornung 訳と照合し、混成と時刻の帰属を訂正した。", "read_id": "READ-20270203-61585a", "reading": "contested", "session_id": "SESSION-20270203-9dddc8", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261104-a75fe8", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-04", "note": "階梯名の典拠をヒエロニムス『書簡』107.2 に照合し、モザイクへの帰属を訂正した。", "read_id": "READ-20270203-6804e4", "reading": "contested", "session_id": "SESSION-20270203-9dddc8", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261104-be074d", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-04", "note": "Thomas 1913 を照合し、逐語一致と訳者帰属を確認した。", "read_id": "READ-20270203-8d9153", "reading": "quoted", "session_id": "SESSION-20270203-9dddc8", "target": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261104-b8efc6", "type": "material"}}
